tex of R is (4,3), and the long rectangle edge is 3y=x+11. Writing R's top vertex as (h,0), the rectangle conditions give (h-7)(h-8)=0. These yield actual areas 9/5 and 5/3, whose sum is 52/15. Thus m+n=67.","status":"matches"},"assessed":false,"bank":"amc","coverage":"canonical_concept_only","flags":[],"questionId":"2021_Fall_AMC_10B_Q25","reviewStatus":"machine_scope_audited","routes":[{"contextNodeIds":["cnm_p077","cnm_174","cnm_177","cnm_183","cnm_p173","cnm_p168"],"id":"coordinates-and-pythagoras","label":"Coordinates and perpendicular sides","methodDirectNodeIds":{"coordinates-and-pythagoras":["cnm_084","cnm_245","cnm_186","cnm_188","cnm_224","cnm_p089","math:similar-figure-area-scaling"]},"nodeIds":["cnm_084","cnm_245","cnm_186","cnm_188","cnm_224","cnm_p089","math:similar-figure-area-scaling","cnm_p077","cnm_174","cnm_177","cnm_183","cnm_p173","cnm_p168"]}]}],"layer":"ailleo","meaning":"Reviewed content-bound concept practice; no claim of complete source-standard coverage or learner mastery.","nextOffset":null,"nodeId":"cnm_177","status":"mapped","total":50}
